<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South Africa's JSE financial index hits new high.</title>
<headline>South Africa's JSE financial index hits new high.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) financial index closed at an all-time high of 8,695, the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>The previous high of 8,678 was hit on March 13, earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
